From 0d4a267a5744b9b4cc2068c351a2465e43e433c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 14:17:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash routing so backend
 commands are not prompts

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent messages through a provider command path instead of normal model prompts, including prompts queued while the session is busy. Codex implements the exposed app-server command subset and unsupported providers return a visible no-op response without sending a model turn.
